  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 Bundles apex-grid 3.6.0 (was 3.3.0), which drops the Ignite UI dependency and adds right-to-left layout, keyboard editing, reduced-motion and forced-colors support, and many filtering, editing and export fixes. New: ApplyEditsAsync writes a batch of cells as one undo step; RowIdKey keeps row pins, manual row order and saved selection across data changes; GridExpansionConfiguration.ExportParts; OnRowMoving/OnRowMoved carry Position and ToIndex. Behaviour to note: a change to Data now clears undo history, Home/End move within the row, CSV export escapes leading formula characters, and currency, rating and progress columns filter as numbers.",
